---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Premium Shibari & Kinbaku Bondage Rope, Equipment, and Learning Resources"
  description="We sell high quality bondage shibari and kinbaku rope and equipment. Our rope comes in a wide array of colors. We take pride in our competitive prices and excellent customer service."
>
  <div id="slider">
    <a href="/"><img src="/images/logo_try_II.png" alt="Welcome to EpicRope!" style="width:100%;" /></a>
  </div>

  <div id="home_content" class="col_w960">
    <div id="home_left_column" class="col_w600 float_l">
      <div id="left_header" class="home_header" style="font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:15px;">Check Out!</div>

      <div class="feature_button lp_box">
        <a href="/rope">
          <img src="/img/scarlet_home_icon.png" class="image_wrapper" alt="Japanese Jute! Now in color!" style="width:290px;" />
          <div class="feature-stripe"><h1 style="font-size:28px; margin:0;">Shibari Jute, now in color!</h1></div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="feature_button lp_box">
        <a href="/rope/shibari_jute/natural">
          <img src="/img/osada_jute.png" class="image_wrapper" alt="New! EpicRope.com is now proudly a supplier of Japanese Jute!" style="width:290px;" />
          <div class="feature-stripe"><h1 style="font-size:24px; margin:0;">EpicRope.com is now a proud supplier of Shibari Jute!</h1></div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="feature_button lp_box">
        <a href="/rainbow_rope/">
          <img src="/img/rainbow.png" class="image_wrapper" alt="Check out our Rainbow Rope!" style="width:290px;" />
          <div class="feature-stripe"><h1 style="font-size:28px; margin:0;">Check out our Rainbow Rope!</h1></div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="feature_button lp_box">
        <a href="/rope/">
          <img src="/img/rope_black.png" class="image_wrapper" alt="Shop for bondage rope" style="width:290px;" />
          <div class="feature-stripe"><h1 style="font-size:28px; margin:0;">Check out our awesome Shibari rope!</h1></div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="feature_button lp_box">
        <a href="/equipment">
          <img src="/img/equipment_black.png" class="image_wrapper" alt="Shop for rope suspension equipment" style="width:290px;" />
          <div class="feature-stripe"><h1 style="font-size:28px; margin:0;">We have great gear, too!</h1></div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="feature_button lp_box">
        <a href="/books/">
          <img src="/img/books_black.png" class="image_wrapper" alt="Shop for rope bondage books and DVDs" style="width:290px;" />
          <div class="feature-stripe"><h1 style="font-size:28px; margin:0;">Learning Books and DVDs!</h1></div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="home_right_column" class="col_w300 float_r">
      <div class="caption card" style="margin-bottom:15px;">
        <p><b>Exciting News!</b></p>
        <p>Our new <a href="/tutorials/basics/">tutorials</a> section is up and running!</p>
      </div>

      <div class="home_header" style="font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:15px;">Welcome to Epic Rope!</div>

      <div class="caption card" style="margin-bottom:15px;">
        <p><b>Our Mission</b></p>
        <p>If you're interested in Shibari, Kinbaku, or that great old North American rope bondage, you've come to the right place. Welcome, friend, to EpicRope.com.</p>
        <p>Our goal is to help erotic rope bondage grow. We seek to do this by promoting the Rope Bondage, Shibari community and encouraging individual passions with rope. We provide the highest quality <a href="/rope/">Shibari bondage rope</a>, <a href="/equipment/">suspension gear</a>, and <a href="/books/">educational books</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="caption card" style="margin-bottom:15px;">
        <p><b>Our Shop</b></p>
        <p>We offer you&hellip;</p>
        <ul>
          <li>The highest quality <a href="/rope/">Shibari bondage rope</a>, hand treated and dyed to provide the optimum look and feel.</li>
          <li>Choose from <a href="/rope/jute/scarlet">jute bondage rope</a>, <a href="/rope/hemp/natural">hemp bondage rope</a>, or <a href="/rope/shibari_jute/natural">premium Japanese jute rope</a>.</li>
          <li>Our rope bondage suspension gear is first rate.</li>
          <li>For those just starting out, we offer excellent Shibari educational books.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="caption card">
        <p><b>More To Come!</b></p>
        <p>We are all about you and we have plans to make EpicRope.com more than just a shop. Resources are coming to help you with your rope bondage and erotic Shibari journey. Check back often for updates!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
